    {
      "name": "Steam Cloud",
      "category": "reaction",
      "placement": "reactions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "reaction",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When the hverhuldra takes cold damage, it uses the steam from the impact of the cold on its body to magically create a cloud of steam centered on a point it can see within 60 feet of it. This cloud works like the fog cloud spell, except the hverhuldra can dismiss it as a bonus action."
      ]
